{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Set BPM to a specific value\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Usage\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Just run the script from Actions Type new BPM value in the prompt\par}
}

