{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 This script provides icons and fonts for Subtitle scripts.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 To use:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab Install the script.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab Copy the icons in Data\\toolbar_icons Reaper's resource path (Options > Show REAPER resource path in explorer/finder).\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab Install the fonts by double-clicking on them and clicking "Install" in the font viewer.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 4.\tx360\tab Restart Reaper if it was open during installation.\sa180\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
