{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 Chirick's Subtitle Scripts\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Scripts for REAPER to work with subtitles and voiceover for video content \u8212- import, export, visualization, and real-time display.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://forum.cockos.com/showthread.php?p=2935723"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
{\cf1 [image: https://img.shields.io/badge/REAPER-6.0+-blue?style=flat-square]\cf0}
}}}
 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reddit.com/r/Reaper/comments/1skaa8e/chiricks_subtitle_scripts_subtitle_voiceover/"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
{\cf1 [image: https://img.shields.io/badge/Reddit-Discussion-orange?style=flat-square]\cf0}
}}}
 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "LICENSE"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
{\cf1 [image: https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg?style=flat-square]\cf0}
}}}
 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://patreon.com/chirick"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
{\cf1 [image: https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-Patreon-orange?style=flat-square]\cf0}
}}}
 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ko-fi.com/chirick"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
{\cf1 [image: https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-Ko--fi-red?style=flat-square]\cf0}
}}}
 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://youtu.be/sM-Q4fyQ2ds"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
{\cf1 [image: https://img.shields.io/badge/YouTube-Channel-red?style=flat-square]\cf0}
}}}
\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u55357 ?\u56570 ? Video Presentation\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u9889 ? Installation\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab Install {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://reapack.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
ReaPack
}}}
\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab In REAPER: {\b Extensions \u8594 ? ReaPack \u8594 ? Import repositories...}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab Paste the URL and click OK:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi0 \f1 https://github.com/chirick86/ReaperScripts/raw/master/index.xml\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 4.\tx360\tab {\b Extensions \u8594 ? ReaPack \u8594 ? Browse packages} \u8594 ? search "Chirick"\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u55356 ?\u57263 ? Typical Usage Scenario\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab {\b Import} subtitles from SRT/ASS file as text items or regions\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab {\b Prompter} \u8212- read the script during voiceover recording\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab {\b SubOverlay} \u8212- display subtitle text over the video in real-time\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 4.\tx360\tab {\b Export} the finished layout back to SRT\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u55357 ?\u56550 ? Scripts\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 \u55356 ?\u57260 ? Subtitle Scripts\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 No additional dependencies required.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 | Script | Description | |--------|-------------| | {\b Import text items from subtitles} | Imports SRT/ASS as text items. Each item's timing and text match the subtitle. For ASS with roles \u8212- separate track per role | | {\b Import regions from subtitles} | Imports SRT/ASS as project regions. For ASS with roles \u8212- unique color per role | | {\b Export items to SRT} | Exports all items from the selected track to SRT. Text is taken from item Notes | | {\b Export regions to SRT} | Exports all project regions to SRT. Region names become subtitle text | | {\b Create text items from regions} | Converts project regions into text items on a new track. Region names \u8594 ? item Notes | | {\b Create regions from text items} | Converts text items on the selected track into project regions. Item Notes \u8594 ? region names | | {\b Convert SWS subtitles to regions} | Converts SWS S&M subtitle markers into full project regions. \u9888 ?\u65039 ? Save the project before running | | {\b Delete markers} | Deletes all markers in the current project | | {\b Delete regions} | Deletes all regions in the current project | | {\b Icons and fonts} | Installs toolbar icons and fonts for the subtitle scripts |\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 \u55357 ?\u56741 ?\u65039 ? ReaImGui Scripts\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Real-time GUI tools. Require {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/cfillion/reaimgui"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
ReaImGui
}}}
 (install via ReaPack).\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 | Script | Description | |--------|-------------| | {\b Prompter} | Script/teleprompter panel \u8212- shows regions or text items as a scrollable list, highlights the current line during playback, supports click-to-jump navigation, search, and combined regions+items view. Can auto-launch SubOverlay on start. {\b Requires:} ReaImGui + JS_ReaScript Extensions | | {\b SubOverlay} | Subtitle overlay on the REAPER video window \u8212- shows current and next line during playback. Attaches to and follows the video window. Supports transparent background, progress bar, font/color/shadow customization, and "fill gaps" mode. {\b Requires:} ReaImGui |\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u10024 ? Key Features\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \u9989 ? {\b SRT and ASS formats} \u8212- with auto-encoding detection (UTF-8, CP1251, CP866)\line \u9989 ? {\b ASS role separation} \u8212- separate tracks or unique colors per character\line \u9989 ? {\b Batch import} \u8212- multiple files at once with format auto-detection\line \u9989 ? {\b Bidirectional conversion} \u8212- regions \u8596 ? text items\line \u9989 ? {\b Real-time display} \u8212- Prompter and SubOverlay sync with playback position\line \u9989 ? {\b Fully customizable UI} \u8212- fonts, colors, sizes, transparency for each element\line \u9989 ? {\b Video window integration} \u8212- SubOverlay follows the REAPER video window\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u55357 ?\u56523 ? Requirements\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 | Component | Required for | |-----------|-------------| | REAPER 6.0+ | All scripts | | ReaPack | Installation and updates | | ReaImGui | Prompter, SubOverlay | | JS_ReaScript Extensions | Prompter |\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 \u55356 ?\u57256 ? Icons & Fonts\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The {\f1 icons_fonts_readme} folder contains toolbar icons and font recommendations. After installation via ReaPack \u8212- copy icons to {\f1 REAPER\\Data\\toolbar_icons} and assign them via right-click on the toolbar button.\par}
}
